## Context

This is an Eval-Driven Development approach. You're creating the types, test fixtures, and eval criteria FIRST — before any implementation. The fixtures and criteria define "what correct looks like" so subsequent tasks can implement against them.

The project is TypeScript ESM ("type": "module"). Use `.js` extensions in imports.
Working directory: /Users/giladkoch/dev/intent-ai

