```json
{"type":"user","uuid":"u-002","parentUuid":"a-001","isSidechain":false,"timestamp":"2026-05-20T10:00:10.000Z","sessionId":"test-session","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"tu-001","content":"file contents here"},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"tu-002","content":"Edit applied"}]},"userType":"external","cwd":"/project","version":"2.1.0"}
```

**The scenario the fixture must cover:**

1. User asks a question: "How does the auth middleware work?"
2. AI responds with text + reads 2 files (multi-block turn)
3. Tool results come back
